00:26:39.446 --> 00:26:40.726
Cache and CDN.

551
00:26:41.006 --> 00:26:42.243
Users (DAU):

552
00:26:42.523 --> 00:26:43.462
50 K.

553
00:26:43.742 --> 00:26:45.982
Peak req per second: ~60.

