00:27:06.940 --> 00:27:07.857
What breaks:

564
00:27:08.137 --> 00:27:13.449
Invoices, SMS and emails block requests; report queries slow the primary.

565
00:27:13.729 --> 00:27:14.519
Move:

566
00:27:14.799 --> 00:27:20.175
Queue + workers (Kafka or RabbitMQ); read replica for reports or history.

