00:28:43.362 --> 00:28:44.109
Note:

597
00:28:44.389 --> 00:28:46.522
The journey isn't a ladder you must climb.

598
00:28:46.802 --> 00:28:50.535
Many profitable businesses stay at stage 3 to 4 forever.

599
00:28:50.815 --> 00:28:53.375
Each stage adds permanent operating cost.

600
00:28:53.655 --> 00:29:02.829
Move up only when a measured limit (Ch 02 estimates, load tests, USL fits) says the current stage can't meet the next year's forecast.

