602
00:29:05.355 --> 00:29:07.083
Architecture and Diagrams.

603
00:29:08.333 --> 00:29:11.533
Component view: a stateless, partitioned cart service.

604
00:29:11.813 --> 00:29:13.157
Here is the diagram.

605
00:29:17.007 --> 00:29:22.404
Sequence: happy path, guest adds items, logs in on a different pod, carts merge once.

606
00:29:22.684 --> 00:29:25.479
The sequence diagram walks through it step by step.

607
00:29:25.759 --> 00:29:27.039
W to P1:

608
00:29:27.319 --> 00:29:34.956
PUT or carts or guest or items or ATTA-5KG qty 1 (guest cart id g-91, signed).

609
00:29:35.236 --> 00:29:36.324
P1 to R:

610
00:29:36.604 --> 00:29:40.657
EVALSHA setqty(cart:g-91, ATTA-5KG, 1).

611
00:29:40.937 --> 00:29:43.241
R to P1: ok (1 line).

612
00:29:43.521 --> 00:29:44.780
W to W:

613
00:29:45.060 --> 00:29:48.644
OTP login, then JWT for cust-42.

614
00:29:48.924 --> 00:29:50.204
W to P2:

615
00:29:50.484 --> 00:29:54.281
POST or carts or merge guestCartId: g-91.

616
00:29:54.561 --> 00:29:55.692
P2 to R:

617
00:29:55.972 --> 00:30:01.860
EVALSHA merge(cart:cust-42, cart:g-91, marker merged:g-91).

618
00:30:02.140 --> 00:30:07.495
R to P2: merged 1 line (customer cart now 3 lines), guest cart deleted.

619
00:30:07.775 --> 00:30:09.076
P2 to W:

620
00:30:09.356 --> 00:30:11.191
200 cart (3 lines).

621
00:30:15.041 --> 00:30:19.585
Sequence: failure path, retry of a merge and a pod dying mid-request.

622
00:30:19.865 --> 00:30:22.659
The sequence diagram walks through it step by step.

623
00:30:22.939 --> 00:30:24.219
W to P2:

624
00:30:24.499 --> 00:30:27.102
POST or carts or merge g-91.

625
00:30:27.382 --> 00:30:28.513
P2 to R:

626
00:30:28.793 --> 00:30:31.353
EVALSHA merge(...), then committed atomically.

627
00:30:31.633 --> 00:30:35.366
P2 to W: pod killed (scale-in) before responding.

628
00:30:35.646 --> 00:30:40.169
W to P3: retry POST or carts or merge g-91.

629
00:30:40.449 --> 00:30:41.579
P3 to R:

630
00:30:41.859 --> 00:30:43.118
EVALSHA merge(...).

631
00:30:43.398 --> 00:30:49.969
R to P3: marker merged:g-91 exists, then 0 lines merged (no double quantities).

632
00:30:50.249 --> 00:30:51.614
P3 to W:

633
00:30:51.894 --> 00:30:54.049
200 cart (same 3 lines).

634
00:30:57.899 --> 00:30:58.645
Note:

635
00:30:58.925 --> 00:31:01.699
What the system guarantees after this failure path.

636
00:31:01.979 --> 00:31:10.064
The merge happens exactly once, because the Lua script checks and sets the merge marker in the same atomic step as the merge itself.

637
00:31:10.344 --> 00:31:14.483
A retry on any pod returns the same cart without doubling quantities.

638
00:31:14.763 --> 00:31:19.051
Scale-in or a crash loses only the in-flight response, never cart state.

639
00:31:20.401 --> 00:31:21.979
State: cart lifecycle.

640
00:31:22.259 --> 00:31:23.603
Here is the diagram.

