01:00:33.513 --> 01:00:41.193
1,000 carts, 8 concurrent pods (one stale, still on map v6) writing to every cart while a sweeper moves them:

1075
01:00:42.543 --> 01:00:54.788
On screen: before move: blr-a carts=1000 blr-b=0. after move: blr-a carts=0 blr-b=1000 carts missing a line:

1076
01:00:55.068 --> 01:00:56.284
0 write errors:

1077
01:00:56.564 --> 01:00:59.337
0. stale pod now on map v7.

